{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a24h-admin-service-0001",
    "name": "alerta24h-admin-service",
    "description": "Smoke tests do serviço admin-service do Alerta24h (context-path /admin).\n\nAuth (DIFERENTE do alert/events):\n- O admin protege tudo atras do form login (OAuth2/OIDC + sessao); rotas de UI/actuator redirecionam para /admin/login (302).\n- As rotas REST sob `/admin/api/**` sao permitAll quanto a sessao, porem o ApiKeyFilter exige o header `x-api-key` em TEXTO PURO (UUID `ADMIN_API_KEY` = 7fa3b52f-...), NAO o esquema AES cifrado do alert/events.\n\nFoco: o endpoint `GET /admin/api/v1/products/code/{code}` e a fonte da validacao de serial usada pelo alert no cadastro (os 5 primeiros digitos do serial = product.code). Requer um produto seedado no admin (ver RB-0009 Passo 0 / DD-0012).\n\nComportamento real (2026-06-12, localhost:8084):\n- /admin/actuator/health -> 302 (login)\n- /admin/api/v1/products/code/{code valido} + x-api-key -> 200 {id,name,priority,...}\n- mesmo endpoint SEM x-api-key -> 401\n- /admin/api/v1/products/code/{code inexistente} + x-api-key -> 404",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      { "key": "key", "value": "x-api-key", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "value", "value": "{{ADMIN_API_KEY}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "[00] Saúde",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health (atrás do login)",
          "protocolProfileBehavior": { "followRedirects": false },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 302 (redireciona para /admin/login)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(302);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Location aponta para /admin/login', function () {",
                  "    var loc = pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '';",
                  "    pm.expect(loc).to.include('/admin/login');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ADMIN_BASE_URL}}/actuator/health",
              "host": ["{{ADMIN_BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["actuator", "health"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "[01] Produtos (validação de serial)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Categoria por code de produto (válido)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('Retorna a categoria (id + name)', function () {",
                  "    var b = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(b).to.be.an('object');",
                  "    pm.expect(b).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(b).to.have.property('name');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ADMIN_BASE_URL}}/api/v1/products/code/{{ADMIN_PRODUCT_CODE}}",
              "host": ["{{ADMIN_BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "products", "code", "{{ADMIN_PRODUCT_CODE}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Categoria por code inexistente → 404",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 404 (code sem produto)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ADMIN_BASE_URL}}/api/v1/products/code/{{ADMIN_PRODUCT_CODE_UNKNOWN}}",
              "host": ["{{ADMIN_BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "products", "code", "{{ADMIN_PRODUCT_CODE_UNKNOWN}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "[02] Erros de Autenticação",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[Erro] /admin/api sem x-api-key",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401 sem x-api-key', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ADMIN_BASE_URL}}/api/v1/products/code/{{ADMIN_PRODUCT_CODE}}",
              "host": ["{{ADMIN_BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "products", "code", "{{ADMIN_PRODUCT_CODE}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
